  (text "Takes power from the 6S battery. The protection IC limits current and disconnects an unsafe supply.\nPower passes through the f02a shunt, then leaves through J701 on f07. f08 provides the on/off switch.\nThis is battery-voltage power, not a regulated 24 V supply. Propulsion manages its own loads."
    (at 15.24 22.86 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "7deeb536-c5ad-4c0b-aad1-6d40e0c07eec")))
